{"id":1010103,"name":"迪蒙·审查Ⅲ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"迪蒙·审查Ⅲ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010103]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10103,"stage":"阶段3","unlock_time":"2022-11-10 18:00:00","diary1":"距离审判越来越近了。\n　　这场审判将由市议会主持，多方势力参与。FAC、MBCC以及神秘的第九机关都会到场。关于迪蒙的一切罪案和故事，都将接近尾声。","diary2":"谁都没有想到，审判以这样一种惨烈的形式收场了。\n　　市议会自上而下开始了一场清洗。看来第九机关的工作进行得很顺利。\n　　而迪蒙，市议会已经自顾不暇，MBCC将是他最终的归宿。因为过去的罪案，以及袭击市议会审判官的暴行，他必须永远为MBCC战斗。没有保释，没有减刑，直到生命的尽头。","evidence":[{"ID":260082,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260083,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":3,"dialogue_id":110103011,"next":[12]},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110103023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110